      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "(Please note: I already had a quote from Top Power Electrical when I asked for recommendation from 2 more installers). I chose Top Power Electrical because of personal recommendations - the company has a good reputation in my local area. Stuart and the team turned up on time, they are a well-oiled team, working well together and they are good communicators. The panels were installed quickly and efficiently, all connections to the internet made using Enphase inverters. They also organised connection to the grid. So far I am very happy with the installation, but it's too early to tell how it will perform in the long run.",
