      "review_description": "Quoting process was easy,  Stuart took all my requests on board and suggested good solutions for our complicated system (which wasn't complicated once he was finished) making sure we retained our 3 phase system.On the day of installation,  the team arrived early and didn't muck around,  before i knew it,  the system was up.  They then made sure they tidied up any rubbish and left the site in the same codifying as when they arrived.Stuart then explained the system to me,  showed me through the app and answered any questions i had.  All interactions with Stuart and the other electricians installing (and they were electricians) were friendly,  polite and respectful.I highly recommend Top Power Electrical",
