      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Top Power have only recently signed up to Solar Quotes, and so had NO reviews when I chose to go with them. It was a risk that paid off handsomely.The whole process was incredibly smooth and efficient with our 11.1 kW system, plus Tesla Powerwall installed and up and running within one day. Stuart handled everything very professionally and took me through how the monitoring ap works so I feel confident that we can get the best out of the system. He answered all of my questions and guided me through to my final choice of the system that meets our needs.Attention to detail was impressive, right down to the effort put in to making the trench (from the panel install on the shed back to the house) as unobtrusive as possible. I am a very satisfied customer.",
